{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "743fd562ccb04f1f73eac9aec70d2acebaf7899dfe8598f22bc8fbcb2d717380", "ja": "（仕事中だけど、小腹が空いたな……。\n給湯室に、何か食べるものはなかったかな？）", "zh": "（现在还是工作时间，但有点饿了……\n茶水间有没有什么吃的呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "9079442099839fbab5a649d894a1abe3df19ebdb8a5630982774949aea75daea", "ja": "おや？　{$P$}さんでしたか～。\nお仕事、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀？原来是{$P$}先生～\n工作辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4cfbf8c712bfe589c53d42eb9a7a05ec0d69dd7081bf1a5443b9022a359f82fa", "ja": "美也、お疲れさま！\nん？　サンドイッチ……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "美也，辛苦你了！\n嗯？你怎么拿着……三明治？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "151903f64e03890a23221502f7d0f58bf1561a4127b6b8e2f41025a7e4a9d2e3", "ja": "はい～。実はこの前、莉緒さんと\n水着を買いに行ったんです～。", "zh": "是的～\n其实我上次跟莉绪姊去买泳装了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "3f5458696e81a02a199a9ca6d01cfc3995e3fce6aac3df5ca2893b8f0bfe006a", "ja": "そのとき、『水着にエプロンをすると\n最高にセクシーよ！』と教えてもらったんです～。", "zh": "她当时跟我说～\n『穿泳装配围裙是最性感的喔！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "725bbda23dbbd080f9edee5a19976658fb87be04caad735ee1c3369e8695ecde", "ja": "いったい、何の話をしているんだ……。\nまあ、莉緒には後で説明を求めるとして。", "zh": "你们到底聊了什么啊……\n算了，之后我再叫莉绪解释一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3c6e74571f64cb1dc64c0f1a64d1f1f48fc1625a71dbd09ed02eb409173458ee", "ja": "で、それとサンドイッチと、何の関係があるんだ？", "zh": "那这件事跟三明治有什么关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "76e894be8760bf62d7501f16768c2b711a663fb63099755dbb3a386b4f78628d", "ja": "はい～。せっかくなので試してみようと思って、\nお母さんのエプロンを借りたんです～。", "zh": "有的～人家都好心告诉我了，我就想试试看，\n于是借了妈妈的围裙～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "d26d256232c48fcc6b5a4ee2f37f22f4da05613941a5f0f4432258c18c375754", "ja": "そうしたら、なんだか\nお料理がしたい気分になりまして～。", "zh": "结果穿上以后，\n就觉得好想下厨～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "98a6c3fa0875b55e220486a5d958587c916afdb7a40cce1cf6b6e432402f38d2", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで、サンドイッチを作ってきたのか……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以你才做了三明治带来啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "48eeaa476ddb43b388ed65c92b90939728738fdfbd34219bde59295a9ab735e2", "ja": "はい～、そうなんです～。\n{$P$}さん、鋭いですな～。", "zh": "是的～没有错～\n{$P$}先生反应真快～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "bfc6a44c68f5883c54e64b0d4cfa295a8167f7ea3fff5c3997cfc3b76710197c", "ja": "サンドイッチ、たくさん作ってきたんですよ～。\nせっかくですから、食べませんか～？", "zh": "我做了很多三明治喔～\n反正都拿来了，你要不要吃呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "274fd907317b1ab368f2ebf88dbfd1d5de04b4e98b8912441f04d7b466e7b655", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。いただくよ！\nちょうど、お腹が空いてたんだ。", "zh": "好啊，谢谢，我就不客气了！\n正好我也肚子饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "89391f15aa3310f2905289b5731d4f85148ecf45441eac4c49d2e8308d9e99db", "ja": "お～、それならよかったです～。\n私、サンドイッチは得意料理なんですよ～。", "zh": "哦～那太好了～\n三明治是我的拿手好菜喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "01da9290484ebde90b1262f93abab6231b4f00c25560f949158aa5129e6805f3", "ja": "こっちはツナときゅうり、たまごとハム……\n甘いものもありますよ～。", "zh": "这个是夹鲔鱼跟小黄瓜，还有火腿蛋……\n也有甜的口味喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a0213a2133ec00fa8dbdcca5959936b190b43c2bdc80041d05de23917d6d5554", "ja": "本当だ、いろんな種類があるんだな……。\nうん、どれも美味しそうだ。", "zh": "真的耶，有好多种类……\n嗯，每个看起来都很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "ae93688311f3b20f26454b2af7cfc511e1c8b4fea48fbea45b233577d0c9839a", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，谢谢你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "5394154ac502ded2759298f70f36bb9df3ae88dee53a19bd3fb2e89327e8c28b", "ja": "水着でお料理をしたから、きっと\n涼しげな味になっていますよ～♪", "zh": "因为我是穿泳装做菜的，\n所以吃起来一定会很凉快喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0594e04134967332c784f894cb1dc0dd74ad77dec640829517ee51d7490cdb29", "ja": "（涼しげよりも、むしろ美也の温かさを感じるな。\nありがとう、美也！）", "zh": "（比起凉快，反而更能感觉到美也带来的暖意呢。\n谢谢你，美也！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
